  "captions": {
    "tiktok": "Don't walk into a musical audition with only sixteen bars. They ask for a monologue too. Seymour, Little Shop of Horrors (Howard Ashman), 0:48, in Ghost Light. The voice is AI. #musicaltheatre #audition #monologue #actortok #theatrekid",
    "youtube_title": "Don't walk into a musical audition with only sixteen bars.",
    "youtube_description": "Don't walk into a musical audition with only sixteen bars.\nThe notice wants sixteen bars and a one minute monologue. Milo has forty songs in his tote and not one speech. In Ghost Light he typed Little Shop of Horrors and up came Seymour, 0:48, with the show and Howard Ashman's credit. Free on the App Store. Built by a working actor. The voice is AI.\n#musicaltheatre #audition #monologue #acting",
    "instagram": "Don't walk into a musical audition with only sixteen bars.\n\nThe notice says sixteen bars AND a one minute monologue. Which one did you forget last time?\n\nMilo had forty songs and zero speeches. What he did in Ghost Light:\n1. Tap Search.\n2. Type the show: Little Shop of Horrors.\n3. Open Seymour (book and lyrics by Howard Ashman), 0:48.\n4. Tap Run it.\n\nFree on the App Store, built by a working actor. Link in bio. The voice is AI.\n\n#musicaltheatre #audition #monologue #actorslife #littleshopofhorrors"
  },
